                    "_type": "Diesel Product Footer",
                    "copy": "© 2020 Invisible Walls ApS. First Class Trouble™ is a trademark of Invisible Walls ApS and exclusively distributed by Versus Evil LLC. Versus Evil ® is a registered trademark of Versus Evil LLC. All rights reserved.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
